  verification: safe on Python 3.13 single-loop; no action.

## Breaking Changes

- `API_GATEWAY_REQUIRE_AUTH` now defaults to `true`; deployments relying on
  the implicit open gateway must set it to `false` explicitly.
- PBFT rejects unsigned messages by default; test harnesses must set
  `pbft_require_signatures=false` explicitly.
- `import_block` RPC rejects blocks that fail sync validation;
  `import_chain` requires admin auth.
- `aitbc.tee` sealing/session functions raise without an explicit secret.
- Bridge monitor rejects deposits below the minimum AIT threshold.

